uplink-desperado-name = Desperado Bundle
uplink-desperado-desc = For those that are too far gone, this sidearm is their only companion. A .45 magnum with a 12 round magazine. Purchase includes a spacious holster and four spare mags.

uplink-minigun-name = Jörmungandr minigun
uplink-minigun-desc = Become one with the great serpent, slowly attritioning the enemy with suppressive fire. Carries 1,000 .10 minigun rounds.

uplink-psibreaker-name = psi-breaker
uplink-psibreaker-desc = A sleek pistol with an engraved marble grip. Capable of launching custom 5u syringe bullets. Legends tell of a school of monks that used these to hunt down psychic threats. Yeah right.

uplink-trinity-name = trinity
uplink-trinity-desc = There are some deeds that a humble servant's hands cannot achieve alone. Like ending someone's life at range in a 3 round burst. Comes pre-loaded with .45 holy ammo.

uplink-lollipop-name = healing lollipop
uplink-lollipop-desc = Lick your wounds and candy at the same time! An innocent lolipop filled with bicaridine and hyperzine. Beware that eating is less effective way of healing than injection. Don't eat it too quickly.
